          "type": "theory",
          "text": "<p>(a) Explain internal organization of \\( 16 \\times 2 \\) memory chips using suitable diagrams.\n                        Calculate the maximum rate at which data can be stored and read for a memory having following\n                        timing parameters:</p>\n<table border=\"1\" style=\"width:100%; text-align:left; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Parameter</th>\n<th>Time (ns)</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Read to Output Valid Time \\( (t_{RD}) \\)</td>\n<td>70</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Data Setup Time \\( (t_{DW}) \\)</td>\n<td>120</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Read to Cycle Time \\( (t_{RC}) \\)</td>\n<td>200</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Write Release Time \\( (t_{WR}) \\)</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Write Cycle \\( (t_{WC}) \\)</td>\n<td>200</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>"
        },
